  "summary": "整篇形式证明尚未通过 Lean Kernel；请查看原稿锚点、编译诊断和翻译缺口，不能据此判定原数学证明错误。",
  "sourceSteps": [
    {
      "id": "source-0",
      "index": 0,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 155,
      "end": 278,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第1步。由(1)取k=0得到1∈S。我们先证明任意n∈S及任意k≥0，A^k n∈S。将n唯一拆成n=n_0 n_A，其中gcd(n_0,A)=1且n_A的每个素因子整除A；于是gcd(n_0,n_A)=1，且n_0|n，故由(2)知n_0∈S。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_0",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-1",
      "index": 1,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 279,
      "end": 410,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第2步。对给定k≥0，因n_A所有素因子都整除A，可选足够大的正整数M使A^k n_A整除A^M。由(1)(2)得A^k n_A∈S。gcd(n_0,A^k n_A)=1，由(3)得n_0(A^k n_A)=A^k n∈S。这个结论对A=1也成立（n_A=1）。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_1",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-2",
      "index": 2,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 411,
      "end": 461,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第3步。由第2步及(4)，对任意n∈S与任意k≥1，A^k n+B=A(A^(k-1)n)+B∈S。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_2",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-3",
      "index": 3,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 462,
      "end": 578,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第4步。关键引理：对任意n∈S，n+B∈S。令t=n+B，将t=t_A t_0，其中t_A由t中所有整除A的素数幂组成，gcd(t_0,A)=1，且gcd(t_A,t_0)=1。因为t_A整除某个A^M，由(1)(2)知t_A∈S。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_3",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-4",
      "index": 4,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 579,
      "end": 744,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第5步。若t_0=1则t_0=1∈S；若t_0>1，因为gcd(A,t_0)=1，欧拉定理给出某个正整数k使A^k≡1 (mod t_0)。于是A^k n+B≡n+B=t≡0 (mod t_0)。由第3步A^k n+B∈S、由(2)得t_0∈S。再由(3)与gcd(t_A,t_0)=1得n+B=t_A t_0∈S。关键引理得证。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_4",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-5",
      "index": 5,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 745,
      "end": 790,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第6步。因为1∈S，反复应用第4、5步得到1+jB∈S，对每个非负整数j成立（对j归纳）。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_5",
      "dependsOn": []
    },
    {
      "id": "source-6",
      "index": 6,
      "role": "inference",
      "start": 791,
      "end": 912,
      "sourceExcerpt": "第7步。任取正整数n满足gcd(n,B)=1。Bezout恒等式保证存在整数x,j使nx=1+jB；通过把x,j同时按通解调整，可取x≥1且j≥0。因而nx=1+jB∈S；再由(2)及n|nx，得到n∈S。任意与B互素的正整数都属于S。证毕。",
      "status": "translation_mapped_only",
      "kernelVerified": false,
      "sourcePositionsValid": true,
      "originalInferenceVerified": false,
      "sourceEquivalenceCertified": false,
      "leanWitnessMarker": "source_step_6",
      "dependsOn": []
    }
  ],
